  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/65c1f464b8b07da5d4de8060b4d21595b089fe8b.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1280\" height=\"567\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fblueprint\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://tinyurl.com/ycyjpbeb&amp;n=-1\" alt=\"需要 Blueprint\"></a> <a href=\"https://discord.gg/6uRtghgWnE\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/780149719611473930?color=526557&amp;label= &amp;labelColor=54ab6b&amp;logoColor=white&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=discord\" alt=\"Discord\"></a> <a href=\"https://github.com/rosevcook/windswept-delights\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Github-Team_Galena?label=&amp;color=c589d0&amp;labelColor=ffa0eb&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=Github&amp;logoColor=white\" alt=\"Github\"></a></p><h3>📖 關於：</h3><ul>\n<li>由 Windswept 的創作者製作，此模組為 Windswept 與 Farmer's Delight 之間添加了相容性！你可以找到栗木、冬青木、松木的儲物櫃、肉串、雪花冰、冰棒、蛋糕片、新的碗裝食物，以及 Windswept 物品的更多切割與烹飪配方。</li>\n</ul><h3>📖 需要前置模組：</h3><ul>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fwindswept\" rel=\"nofollow\">Windswept</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252ffarmers-delight\" rel=\"nofollow\">Farmer's Delight</a></li>\n</ul>",
